  "doctrine": "Calculated ambiguity, extended deterrence and flexible response. The US does not accept a no-first-use commitment; the 2018 Nuclear Posture Review (which the Trump administration said in 2026 it will not replace with a formal NPR) states the US would only consider nuclear employment 'in extreme circumstances to defend the vital interests of the United States, its allies and partners', while…",
