  "assessment": "The most explicit public debate about acquiring nuclear weapons by any NATO member. In February-March 2026 both the President and the Prime Minister publicly endorsed some form of Polish nuclear potential, while the practical near-term track is hosting - either US B61s under NATO nuclear sharing or coverage by the French deterrent. CONFIRMED: the political statements and the US-NATO consultations. SUSPECTED: nothing technical - Poland has no fuel-cycle capability.",
